--- coverage debug 
config 	show configuration settings
data 	summarize data files
premain 	show what is calling coverage
pybehave 	show internal flags describing Python behavior
sqlite 	show SQLite compilation options
sys 	show installation information
--- coverage help 
annotate 
combine 
debug 
